{"allowed_english": [], "context": {"approved_glossary_entries": [], "generation_contexts": [{"context_id": "neighbor:inventory:descent:08WJ:subsection_title/0001", "hash": "sha256:13de7c9d8d0f8231bea1de202f6c82d5d0a13a763fe46cf8b363673253127c0a", "value": {"kind": "locked-English-neighbor", "location": {"byte_end": 33189, "byte_start": 33104, "file": "descent.tex", "fragment_hash": "sha256:f5ebd2a61b49bb406cfcc31138d26085fb094051f94969b7761754dafe64152d", "line_end": 884, "line_start": 883}, "owner_tag": "08WJ", "parent_tag": "08WE", "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_unit": {"chapter": "descent", "node_kind": "subsection_title", "parent_tag": "08WE", "placeholders": {"LOCKED_0001": "\\label{subsection-universally-injective}", "TEXTCLOSE_0001": "}", "TEXTOPEN_0001": "\\subsection{"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R1", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:94e14d2733e496cf1f993ff440536a3ebdb440ccbe6159152174aed7f3c4689e", "source_text": "<TEXTOPEN_0001>Universally injective morphisms<TEXTCLOSE_0001>\n<LOCKED_0001>", "source_text_hash": "sha256:c588ef36a37c0e45cc3966610f860b54e7acb571855fd68a75158f00ed71d706", "unit_id": "inventory:descent:08WJ:subsection_title/0001"}}}, {"context_id": "neighbor:inventory:descent:08WK:remark/0001", "hash": "sha256:8ec49cb4434cae39a0b876cd3d08053cd5d0b12a1500016c01698a3690672c43", "value": {"kind": "locked-English-neighbor", "location": {"byte_end": 33875, "byte_start": 33375, "file": "descent.tex", "fragment_hash": "sha256:5237ee0adaf2eecf2df2544ac3e10fda71e7a89465bdf56faff8b319e848d294", "line_end": 901, "line_start": 891}, "owner_tag": "08WK", "parent_tag": "08WE", "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_unit": {"chapter": "descent", "node_kind": "remark", "parent_tag": "08WE", "placeholders": {"LOCKED_0001": "\\label{remark-reflects}", "MATH_0001": "$F : \\mathcal{A} \\to \\mathcal{B}$", "MATH_0002": "$F$", "MATH_0003": "$f : R \\to S$", "MATH_0004": "$\\bullet \\otimes_R S: \\text{Mod}_R \\to \\text{Mod}_S$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{homology-section-functors}", "STRUCT_0001": "\\begin{remark}", "STRUCT_0002": "\\end{remark}"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:93370aaad8eceeec0d451da28226e89408912bb3aef897bc627ae30a6705694c", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:fb3ace379d4cffb49e563ee6b88628776a5749853d73bd3a48fca1a5e90261a1", "source_text": "<STRUCT_0001>\n<LOCKED_0001>\nAny functor <MATH_0001> of abelian categories\nwhich is exact and takes nonzero objects to nonzero objects reflects\ninjections and surjections. Namely, exactness implies that\n<MATH_0002> preserves kernels and cokernels (compare with\nHomology, Section <REF_0001>).\nFor example, if <MATH_0003> is a \nfaithfully flat ring homomorphism, then\n<MATH_0004> has these properties.\n<STRUCT_0002>", "source_text_hash": "sha256:a3ee89e40ff080fbd163d936e749d286cee00e42bab7c31df6cbc4c15be04c1e", "unit_id": "inventory:descent:08WK:remark/0001"}}}, {"context_id": "neighbor:inventory:descent:08WJ:paragraph/0001", "hash": "sha256:c0fcaddd2aea571a525b5fc0ffb2b17220986979b14824f0d389884560cad526", "value": {"kind": "locked-English-neighbor", "location": {"byte_end": 33373, "byte_start": 33191, "file": "descent.tex", "fragment_hash": "sha256:c234888f859c8be71cdd087f1c8128a1b25d9430ca41296f3a6c8204317d76e8", "line_end": 889, "line_start": 886}, "owner_tag": "08WJ", "parent_tag": "08WE", "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_unit": {"chapter": "descent", "node_kind": "paragraph", "parent_tag": "08WE", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$\\textit{Rings}$", "MATH_0002": "$1$", "MATH_0003": "$R$", "MATH_0004": "$\\textit{Rings}$", "MATH_0005": "$\\text{Mod}_R$", "MATH_0006": "$R$", "STRUCT_0001": "\\noindent"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R1", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:1faefc9b689937ba2644e9c1a62d7ed4eccb5138cdc328c213b41a3348aaf372", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:224369d94d0faa1349dafc2a43f37d700654ad83e8e2e6dcee3859f0699bee3d", "source_text": "<STRUCT_0001>\nRecall that <MATH_0001> denotes the category of commutative rings\nwith <MATH_0002>. For an object <MATH_0003> of <MATH_0004> we denote <MATH_0005>\nthe category of <MATH_0006>-modules.", "source_text_hash": "sha256:0b836533b57ffcdb835077c859b763242403023671e71c9adb8089de43f75154", "unit_id": "inventory:descent:08WJ:paragraph/0001"}}}, {"context_id": "neighbor:inventory:descent:08WJ:paragraph/0002", "hash": "sha256:808d6d8235e28c85267297d7617fd485b3322e3922c570715bd409244e4847d6", "value": {"kind": "locked-English-neighbor", "location": {"byte_end": 34172, "byte_start": 33877, "file": "descent.tex", "fragment_hash": "sha256:8e96764ca1ce8a08bba9ea328a824ef4828f5306a33dc30845c2dfc2d2a25884", "line_end": 907, "line_start": 903}, "owner_tag": "08WJ", "parent_tag": "08WE", "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_unit": {"chapter": "descent", "node_kind": "paragraph", "parent_tag": "08WE", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$R$", "MATH_0002": "$f : M \\to N$", "MATH_0003": "$\\text{Mod}_R$", "MATH_0004": "$P \\in \\text{Mod}_R$", "MATH_0005": "$f \\otimes 1_P: M \\otimes_R P \\to N \\otimes_R P$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{algebra-definition-universally-injective}", "STRUCT_0001": "\\noindent", "TEXTITCLOSE_0001": "}", "TEXTITOPEN_0001": "{\\it "}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R1", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:f7a7db0ab1b8a2e5e3b04322eb380978c26260d29a1909d6cca05aa51e90fbcc", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:6f592303cc0461e20eb2a126de133dae48ab381481f7b3b8e31974dae18108fc", "source_text": "<STRUCT_0001>\nLet <MATH_0001> be a ring. Recall that a morphism <MATH_0002> in <MATH_0003>\nis <TEXTITOPEN_0001>universally injective<TEXTITCLOSE_0001> if for all <MATH_0004>,\nthe morphism <MATH_0005> is injective.\nSee Algebra, Definition <REF_0001>.", "source_text_hash": "sha256:c4f4f9750dd5969b563076dcff6c4e89808993253df8fb46479f8a1fd4f253c0", "unit_id": "inventory:descent:08WJ:paragraph/0002"}}}, {"context_id": "neighbor:inventory:descent:08WL:definition/0001", "hash": "sha256:bc865a800b8b308c681ebce1f13b0a94c840d940cc49452717f5a76b17f83f00", "value": {"kind": "locked-English-neighbor", "location": {"byte_end": 34369, "byte_start": 34174, "file": "descent.tex", "fragment_hash": "sha256:82d485953caea53b53e712c9e3e126dfcffc4e82ba59d4eda4bd2a9b510c03db", "line_end": 913, "line_start": 909}, "owner_tag": "08WL", "parent_tag": "08WE", "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_unit": {"chapter": "descent", "node_kind": "definition", "parent_tag": "08WE", "placeholders": {"LOCKED_0001": "\\label{definition-universally-injective}", "MATH_0001": "$f: R \\to S$", "MATH_0002": "$\\text{Mod}_R$", "STRUCT_0001": "\\begin{definition}", "STRUCT_0002": "\\end{definition}", "TEXTITCLOSE_0001": "}", "TEXTITOPEN_0001": "{\\it "}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:a69b4113b30344ae0ab2dd2d54cdc3130a171464491f7914233fd34c8f3716f9", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:8fd34bfe4ba8a3703f49624097e7e36221603eae8f58f048d0d2527efbbe7b7f", "source_text": "<STRUCT_0001>\n<LOCKED_0001>\nA ring map <MATH_0001> is <TEXTITOPEN_0001>universally injective<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>\nif it is universally injective as a morphism in <MATH_0002>.\n<STRUCT_0002>", "source_text_hash": "sha256:34dab25066260ba28c849860022a3a86b95917a9f7e9d46628246c3cd630430a", "unit_id": "inventory:descent:08WL:definition/0001"}}}, {"context_id": "neighbor:inventory:descent:08WM:example/0001", "hash": "sha256:78066bded6a1cc8d07bd2f901481fd164385d1816590ca1deb8f267c3a4ec02d", "value": {"kind": "locked-English-neighbor", "location": {"byte_end": 34599, "byte_start": 34371, "file": "descent.tex", "fragment_hash": "sha256:4ec72924434a191f8b100ccb3645e5ac961b7e85617f39c8ee5c4277e1e74cd9", "line_end": 919, "line_start": 915}, "owner_tag": "08WM", "parent_tag": "08WE", "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_unit": {"chapter": "descent", "node_kind": "example", "parent_tag": "08WE", "placeholders": {"LOCKED_0001": "\\label{example-split-injection-universally-injective}", "MATH_0001": "$\\text{Mod}_R$", "MATH_0002": "$\\textit{Rings}$", "STRUCT_0001": "\\begin{example}", "STRUCT_0002": "\\end{example}"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:95ca3ca0a1ba030d7e7272d0581b4b34dbed6b917add9bf2cd4b972564bddf62", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:cb259d8501329dbbf08cbc1feba2b229f6f7f7198e75ba9db462f3884541f14f", "source_text": "<STRUCT_0001>\n<LOCKED_0001>\nAny split injection in <MATH_0001> is universally injective. In particular,\nany split injection in <MATH_0002> is universally injective.\n<STRUCT_0002>", "source_text_hash": "sha256:ea02b71f75fae1860cfc22c8f1d7de951cf7cacac7c73edc269a13e0dac58294", "unit_id": "inventory:descent:08WM:example/0001"}}}, {"context_id": "neighbor:inventory:descent:08WN:example/0001", "hash": "sha256:a81b5c96189df2419eb6cd8f2a3f1f45d2fa3b681de398948e0078790e258072", "value": {"kind": "locked-English-neighbor", "location": {"byte_end": 35102, "byte_start": 34601, "file": "descent.tex", "fragment_hash": "sha256:05adafafa9961416f889704579c4390a9d2ba11595d85ab66e11bd1d4ec9b118", "line_end": 930, "line_start": 921}, "owner_tag": "08WN", "parent_tag": "08WE", "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_unit": {"chapter": "descent", "node_kind": "example", "parent_tag": "08WE", "placeholders": {"LOCKED_0001": "\\label{example-cover-universally-injective}", "MATH_0001": "$R$", "MATH_0002": "$f_1, \\ldots, f_n \\in R$", "MATH_0003": "$R \\to R_{f_1} \\oplus \\ldots \\oplus R_{f_n}$", "MATH_0004": "$R$", "MATH_0005": "$f_i$", "MATH_0006": "$R \\to R_{f_i}$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{lemma-faithfully-flat-universally-injective}", "STRUCT_0001": "\\begin{example}", "STRUCT_0002": "\\end{example}"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:9444d66b2ed29f33505cee26bca1e5e02464eee3c4b539df708ec98e20ee427c", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:eb26df140ab1545b53365d740d85719f9846534024879f16ec647923b027b634", "source_text": "<STRUCT_0001>\n<LOCKED_0001>\nFor a ring <MATH_0001> and <MATH_0002> generating the unit\nideal, the morphism <MATH_0003> is\nuniversally injective. Although this is immediate from\nLemma <REF_0001>,\nit is instructive to check it directly: we immediately reduce to the case\nwhere <MATH_0004> is local, in which case some <MATH_0005> must be a unit and so the map\n<MATH_0006> is an isomorphism.\n<STRUCT_0002>", "source_text_hash": "sha256:016a1bb217b4112e2f1c0277ab5104664bacb7449934b5c5c3cdb158f51344fb", "unit_id": "inventory:descent:08WN:example/0001"}}}, {"context_id": "reference:algebra-definition-universally-injective", "hash": "sha256:aa9c153ee0593b7d3b8d1bb4388657f64318e14d2caa73c5d8cb8c403551e36e", "value": {"kind": "locked-English-reference", "location": {"byte_end": 710779, "byte_start": 710349, "file": "algebra.tex", "fragment_hash": "sha256:84ab86e02a20118fc5dee573dae607fc3503495c95c59bd72c6023e4595402c4", "line_end": 19759, "line_start": 19751}, "owner_tag": "058I", "parent_tag": "058H", "requested_label": "algebra-definition-universally-injective", "requested_tag": "058I", "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_unit": {"chapter": "algebra", "node_kind": "definition", "parent_tag": "058H", "placeholders": {"LOCKED_0001": "\\label{definition-universally-injective}", "MATH_0001": "$f: M \\to N$", "MATH_0002": "$R$", "MATH_0003": "$f$", "MATH_0004": "$R$", "MATH_0005": "$Q$", "MATH_0006": "$f\n\\otimes_R \\text{id}_Q: M \\otimes_R Q \\to N \\otimes_R Q$", "MATH_0007": "$0 \\to M_1 \\to M_2 \\to M_3\n\\to 0$", "MATH_0008": "$R$", "MATH_0009": "$M_1 \\to M_2$", "STRUCT_0001": "\\begin{definition}", "STRUCT_0002": "\\end{definition}", "TEXTITCLOSE_0001": "}", "TEXTITCLOSE_0002": "}", "TEXTITOPEN_0001": "{\\it ", "TEXTITOPEN_0002": "{\\it "}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:03c95a5d5f42b26ee5af824b0af0ed7acd8024b572a5d647a4612d1e0b0b6a81", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:d10750243b9e4225235fedd791dc76720b1bb3ab770259e265fefe0861b51524", "source_text": "<STRUCT_0001>\n<LOCKED_0001>\nLet <MATH_0001> be a map of <MATH_0002>-modules.  Then <MATH_0003> is called\n<TEXTITOPEN_0001>universally injective<TEXTITCLOSE_0001> if for every <MATH_0004>-module <MATH_0005>, the map <MATH_0006>\nis injective.  A sequence <MATH_0007> of <MATH_0008>-modules is called <TEXTITOPEN_0002>universally exact<TEXTITCLOSE_0002> if it is exact\nand <MATH_0009> is universally injective.\n<STRUCT_0002>", "source_text_hash": "sha256:b83182307ef83216a6f11395bf191c96fb983d5972c5d2c5fc9dc22fcdf46d3b", "unit_id": "inventory:algebra:058I:definition/0001"}}}, {"context_id": "reference:homology-section-functors", "hash": "sha256:33eeb93fa64b512b2ff85fb9e09308cee5d1bd94110592305f62345226ba2712", "value": {"